{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54751","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金星畔，边有小星侵。\n相去不过咫尺远，客军当败将消沉，兵罢只如今。\n（凡金星爲将星，专主兵权兆。\n京本注：「金星专主兵权之事。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}